      "explanation": "Answer C: Printing Press. Johannes Gutenberg is conventionally credited with introducing the movable-type printing press in Europe. The wording is broad since printing technologies existed earlier elsewhere; the intended European milestone is clear from the options. Reference: https://www.britannica.com/technology/printing-press. Verified worked solution, unofficial. Historical facts are anchored to the original exam; no matching examiner key is asserted.",
